[{"id":"kasaba-10-8-5","words":["verb:kasaba"],"options":[{"bs":"(su) zarađivali","en":"(they used to) earn"},{"bs":"zaradili su","en":"they (two) earned"},{"bs":"zaradio je","en":"he/it earned"},{"bs":"zaradili ste","en":"you (all) earned"}],"ref":"10:8","answerWord":"يَكْسِبُونَ","answerSound":"audio/7c96a65e82951cb86c7e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Their home will be the Fire because of what they used to earn.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaraditi, steći","en":"to earn, to gain"},"passage":["أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","مَأْوَىٰهُمُ","ٱلنَّارُ","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَكْسِبُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"كَسَبَ"}},{"id":"kasaba-42-34-3","words":["verb:kasaba"],"options":[{"bs":"zaradili su","en":"they earned"},{"bs":"zaradili ste","en":"you (all) earned"},{"bs":"zaradio je","en":"he/it earned"},{"bs":"zarađujete","en":"you (all) earn"}],"ref":"42:34","answerWord":"كَسَبُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/5789a7b07033093a3b49.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or He causeth them to perish on account of that which they have earned - And He forgiveth much -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaraditi, steći","en":"to earn, to gain"},"passage":["أَوْ","يُوبِقْهُنَّ","بِمَا","كَسَبُوا۟","وَيَعْفُ","عَن","كَثِيرٍ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"كَسَبَ"}},{"id":"kasaba-6-3-11","words":["verb:kasaba"],"options":[{"bs":"zarađujete","en":"you (all) earn"},{"bs":"zaradili su","en":"they earned"},{"bs":"zarađuje","en":"he/it earns"},{"bs":"zaradili ste","en":"you (all) earned"}],"ref":"6:3","answerWord":"تَكْسِبُونَ","answerSound":"audio/9893e22c510033bdee3c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He is Allah in the heavens and in the earth. He knoweth both your secret and your utterance, and He knoweth what ye earn.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaraditi, steći","en":"to earn, to gain"},"passage":["وَهُوَ","ٱللَّهُ","فِى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَفِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","يَعْلَمُ","سِرَّكُمْ","وَجَهْرَكُمْ","وَيَعْلَمُ","مَا","تَكْسِبُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"كَسَبَ"}},{"id":"kasaba-111-2-5","words":["verb:kasaba"],"options":[{"bs":"zaradio je","en":"he/it earned"},{"bs":"zaradili su","en":"they earned"},{"bs":"zarađujete","en":"you (all) earn"},{"bs":"zarađuje","en":"he/it earns"}],"ref":"111:2","answerWord":"كَسَبَ","answerSound":"audio/dd22b659fddfa7c74396.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"His wealth and gains will not exempt him.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaraditi, steći","en":"to earn, to gain"},"passage":["مَآ","أَغْنَىٰ","عَنْهُ","مَالُهُۥ","وَمَا","كَسَبَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"كَسَبَ"}},{"id":"kasaba-2-134-9","words":["verb:kasaba"],"options":[{"bs":"zaradili ste","en":"you (all) earned"},{"bs":"zaradili su","en":"they earned"},{"bs":"(su) zarađivali","en":"(they used to) earn"},{"bs":"zaradio je","en":"he/it earned"}],"ref":"2:134","answerWord":"كَسَبْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/480c29ce528f354d1c90.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those are a people who have passed away. Theirs is that which they earned, and yours is that which ye earn. And ye will not be asked of what they used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaraditi, steći","en":"to earn, to gain"},"passage":["تِلْكَ","أُمَّةٌ","قَدْ","خَلَتْ","لَهَا","مَا","كَسَبَتْ","وَلَكُم","مَّا","كَسَبْتُمْ","وَلَا","تُسْـَٔلُونَ","عَمَّا","كَانُوا۟","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"كَسَبَ"}},{"id":"kasaba-4-111-1","words":["verb:kasaba"],"options":[{"bs":"zarađuje","en":"he/it earns"},{"bs":"zaradili su","en":"they earned"},{"bs":"zarađuje ga","en":"he/it earns it"},{"bs":"zarađujete","en":"you (all) earn"}],"ref":"4:111","answerWord":"يَكْسِبْ","answerSound":"audio/90c2aa0829f79cc74a58.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whoso committeth sin committeth it only against himself. Allah is ever Knower, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaraditi, steći","en":"to earn, to gain"},"passage":["وَمَن","يَكْسِبْ","إِثْمًا","فَإِنَّمَا","يَكْسِبُهُۥ","عَلَىٰ","نَفْسِهِۦ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمًا","حَكِيمًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"كَسَبَ"}},{"id":"kasaba-4-88-8","words":["verb:kasaba"],"options":[{"bs":"zaradili su","en":"they earned"},{"bs":"zarađujete","en":"you (all) earn"},{"bs":"(su) zarađivali","en":"(they used to) earn"},{"bs":"zarađuje ga","en":"he/it earns it"}],"ref":"4:88","answerWord":"كَسَبُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/09721cde1bffc66ac224.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"What aileth you that ye are become two parties regarding the hypocrites, when Allah cast them back (to disbelief) because of what they earned? Seek ye to guide him whom Allah hath sent astray? He whom Allah sendeth astray, for him thou (O MUhammad) canst not find a road.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaraditi, steći","en":"to earn, to gain"},"passage":["فَمَا","لَكُمْ","فِى","ٱلْمُنَٰفِقِينَ","فِئَتَيْنِ","وَٱللَّهُ","أَرْكَسَهُم","بِمَا","كَسَبُوٓا۟","أَتُرِيدُونَ","أَن","تَهْدُوا۟","مَنْ","أَضَلَّ","ٱللَّهُ","وَمَن","يُضْلِلِ","ٱللَّهُ","فَلَن","تَجِدَ","لَهُۥ","سَبِيلًا"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"كَسَبَ"}},{"id":"kasaba-4-111-4","words":["verb:kasaba"],"options":[{"bs":"zarađuje ga","en":"he/it earns it"},{"bs":"zaradili su","en":"they earned"},{"bs":"zaradili ste","en":"you (all) earned"},{"bs":"zarađujete","en":"you (all) earn"}],"ref":"4:111","answerWord":"يَكْسِبُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/db033621b5c0251dc3d7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whoso committeth sin committeth it only against himself. Allah is ever Knower, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaraditi, steći","en":"to earn, to gain"},"passage":["وَمَن","يَكْسِبْ","إِثْمًا","فَإِنَّمَا","يَكْسِبُهُۥ","عَلَىٰ","نَفْسِهِۦ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمًا","حَكِيمًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"كَسَبَ"}},{"id":"kasaba-5-38-6","words":["verb:kasaba"],"options":[{"bs":"zaradili su","en":"they (two) earned"},{"bs":"zaradio je","en":"he/it earned"},{"bs":"(su) zarađivali","en":"(they used to) earn"},{"bs":"zarađujete","en":"you (all) earn"}],"ref":"5:38","answerWord":"كَسَبَا","answerSound":"audio/27e8b2a8f5f3beb7923d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"As for the thief, both male and female, cut off their hands. It is the reward of their own deeds, an exemplary punishment from Allah. Allah is Mighty, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zaraditi, steći","en":"to earn, to gain"},"passage":["وَٱلسَّارِقُ","وَٱلسَّارِقَةُ","فَٱقْطَعُوٓا۟","أَيْدِيَهُمَا","جَزَآءًۢ","بِمَا","كَسَبَا","نَكَٰلًا","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَزِيزٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"كَسَبَ"}},{"id":"sabba-22-19-12","words":["verb:sabba"],"options":[{"bs":"lije se","en":"he/it is poured"},{"bs":"pa je izlio","en":"so he poured"},{"bs":"izlili smo","en":"we poured"},{"bs":"izlijte","en":"pour"}],"ref":"22:19","answerWord":"يُصَبُّ","answerSound":"audio/8cac74f512e1a355c188.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"These twain (the believers and the disbelievers) are two opponents who contend concerning their Lord. But as for those who disbelieve, garments of fire will be cut out for them; boiling fluid will be poured down on their heads,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izliti, sipati","en":"to pour"},"passage":["هَٰذَانِ","خَصْمَانِ","ٱخْتَصَمُوا۟","فِى","رَبِّهِمْ","فَٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","قُطِّعَتْ","لَهُمْ","ثِيَابٌ","مِّن","نَّارٍ","يُصَبُّ","مِن","فَوْقِ","رُءُوسِهِمُ","ٱلْحَمِيمُ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"صَبَّ"}},{"id":"sabba-44-48-1","words":["verb:sabba"],"options":[{"bs":"izlijte","en":"pour"},{"bs":"izlili smo","en":"we poured"},{"bs":"pa je izlio","en":"so he poured"},{"bs":"lije se","en":"he/it is poured"}],"ref":"44:48","answerWord":"صُبُّوا۟","answerSound":"audio/413700b3c5f4fa345c91.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then pour upon his head the torment of boiling water.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izliti, sipati","en":"to pour"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","صُبُّوا۟","فَوْقَ","رَأْسِهِۦ","مِنْ","عَذَابِ","ٱلْحَمِيمِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"صَبَّ"}},{"id":"sabba-80-25-1","words":["verb:sabba"],"options":[{"bs":"izlili smo","en":"we poured"},{"bs":"lije se","en":"he/it is poured"},{"bs":"izlijte","en":"pour"},{"bs":"pa je izlio","en":"so he poured"}],"ref":"80:25","answerWord":"صَبَبْنَا","answerSound":"audio/130457a339d3ef0b1865.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How We pour water in showers","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izliti, sipati","en":"to pour"},"passage":["أَنَّا","صَبَبْنَا","ٱلْمَآءَ","صَبًّا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"صَبَّ"}},{"id":"sabba-89-13-0","words":["verb:sabba"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je izlio","en":"so he poured"},{"bs":"izlijte","en":"pour"},{"bs":"izlili smo","en":"we poured"},{"bs":"lije se","en":"he/it is poured"}],"ref":"89:13","answerWord":"فَصَبَّ","answerSound":"audio/3300c7a9f6ef80a7b107.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Therefore thy Lord poured on them the disaster of His punishment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izliti, sipati","en":"to pour"},"passage":["فَصَبَّ","عَلَيْهِمْ","رَبُّكَ","سَوْطَ","عَذَابٍ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"صَبَّ"}}]